{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Emails/Confirmation of Your Hotel Korso Reservation.asset": {"Email:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Confirmation of Your Hotel Korso Reservation": {"Email:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Dear Tammi,\n\nWe are delighted to confirm your reservation at Hotel Korso for your upcoming travel dates. Below are the details of your booking:\n\n- Guest Name: Iisakki Tammi\n- Reservation Number: 62496712335\n- Check-in Date: 1.1.1960\n- Check-out Date: 1.1.1960\n- Room Type: The boss's room\n- Number of Guests: 1\n- Total Cost: 1300 RM\n\nPlease review the information above to ensure accuracy. Should you have any questions or require further assistance, feel free to contact our reservations team at 010 337 426 or reply to this email.\n\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you to Hotel Korso and ensuring your stay is comfortable and enjoyable. Thank you for choosing us for your accommodation needs.\n\n\nWarm regards,\n\nKarl Sheppern\nManaging Director\nHotel Korso Obenseuer": {"Email:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Hotel Korso": {"Email:from": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "reservations@hotelkorso.ts": {"Email:fromEmail": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Emails/Elevate Your Space with Ankea's Money Pattern Collection!.asset": {"Email:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Elevate Your Space with Ankea's Money Pattern Collection!": {"Email:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Ankea Marketing": {"Email:from": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "noreply@ankea.ts": {"Email:fromEmail": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Emails/Muddy Markku Cigars at Unbeatable Prices.asset": {"Email:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Muddy Markku Cigars at Unbeatable Prices!": {"Email:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Dear Tammi,\n\nWe're having a sale on Muddy Markku Cigars! Now for a limited time only, indulge in mud without breaking the bank!\n\nWhether you're a cigar aficionado or just looking to try something new, now's the time to snag some quality sticks. Don't miss out!\n\n- Sent from MuddyMarkku.ts -\nMerkki Street 52 B, Stalburg, Stolland": {"Email:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Muddy Markku": {"Email:from": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "marketing@muddymarkku.ts": {"Email:fromEmail": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Emails/Updated security measures.asset": {"Email:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Updated Security Measures": {"Email:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Dear Tammi,\n\nI wanted to inform you of recent security updates we've implemented at the bank. We've attached new lights to security cameras and installed doors that automatically close when the alarm is activated. Also, we have changed the vault access code to \"8888\" as requested.\n\nFeel free to reach out if you need further details.\n\n\nBest regards,\n\nHeikki Mailanen": {"Email:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Heikki Mailanen": {"Email:from": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "heikki.mailanen@stalburg.ts": {"Email:fromEmail": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Happy birthday.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Happy birthday": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Happy 50th birthday Theo! Can you believe it? You've reached the half-century milestone! How can you still be alive?\n\nWell, anyway. I got you a little something - your favorite drink! I hope it adds to the celebration.\n\nAlso, I thought your birthday was on the 16th of November, turns out it's the 16th of December! My bad!\n\nWishing you all the best on your special day, Theo. \n\nI hope this is your last birthday!\n\nWith warmest wishes,\n\nAH\n": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Installation of lights for security cameras.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Installation of lights for security cameras": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "NOTICE!\n\nWe installed lights on the cameras (Because boss said so). Last time someone snagged stuff and our cameras couldn't see that because it was too dark. So those lights are there to make sure the cameras can actually do their job.\n\nAlso, don't try to come here when the bank is closed! If those cameras see you, you must quickly go to the boss's room and enter the correct code! That gas is no joke!\n\nIf you have something to complain about, tell the boss when he comes back from vacation!\n\n-Reiska": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Money curtains.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Money curtains": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Today's been a real pain in the ass!\n\nMy mother bought me new curtains covered in paper money patterns and they look awful! To top it off, they match those damn bed sheets she got me last month.\n\nAnd to add insult to injury, some potato head decided to change the security alarm code to my freakin' birthday.\n\nWell, at least there's coffee. That's one thing keeping me sane in this mess.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/New text document.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "New text document": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "g34mvw334mbe23kvdr\n\n10301030\n\nREMEMBERHK2552610": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Bank/Vault Safe Code 02.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Vault Safe Code 02": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "New Vault Safe Code 02 (lower safe): 12 25 11 24": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Rain": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Fridge": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Outside": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Wood": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Computer": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Vent": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Boiler": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Pipes": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Fuses": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Lamp": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Tasks/Bank of Bazaar/Open the vault.asset": {"TaskObjective:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "BankVault34": {"TaskObjective:id": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Open the vault": {"TaskObjective:title": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Passmore mentioned that upstairs is the boss's room where you can close the surveillance cameras. ": {"TaskObjective:description": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Sender name<color=#6b6b6b> - Very Long Email Title With Stuff That Is Not Good For": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Text Document": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Test content": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Recycle Bin": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Search": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Aug 15": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "File Name": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "File Edit Format View Help": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}, "Filename.txt": {"TextMeshProUGUI:m_text": ["sharedassets35.assets"]}}}